I’ll count days by building a map from heroes to indices. The hero with minimal strength will clear this many monsters, and thus that will be the minimum number of days. If the hero’s strength is not enough to clear all monsters, we need that many more days; if they are all defeated in fewer than that many days, that’s also fine. No recursion needed, just iteration—relatively simple and efficient, no fluff.
